      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "A distributed job scheduler is a system that automates the scheduling and execution of jobs or tasks across multiple machines\nor nodes. It is used to automate repetitive tasks, run scheduled maintenance, or execute batch processes at specified times or\nintervals.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A distributed job scheduler is a system that automates the scheduling and execution of jobs or tasks across multiple machines\nor nodes. It is used to automate repetitive tasks, run scheduled maintenance, or execute batch processes at specified times or\nintervals.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 104
    },
